{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56586","headline":"歌 · 若讷","name":"歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芽若是铅，去铅万里。\n芽若非铅，从铅而始。\n铅爲芽母，芽爲铅子。\n既得金花，舍铅不使。\n（见《正统道藏》本後蜀人着《大还丹照监》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"若讷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}